abstract: >-
  ReadMixer is a high-performance tool for obfuscating FASTQ files with
  dynamic resource management capabilities. The tool automatically detects
  system capabilities and optimizes resource usage for both laptop and
  supercomputer environments. It provides memory-efficient processing through
  streaming approaches with external sorting for large genomic datasets,
  enabling secure data sharing while maintaining research utility.
